  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ODA - ACCORD: Innovation in peace mediation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Accord publication will look to explore the changing realities of conflict and demands of peace-making. This is work is key at a moment of profound geopolitical polarization, deep technological change and the rising prominence of systemic threats such as the climate emergency and infectious disease. The project will develop findings on mediation policy to maintain contemporary relevance, summarise the current context in which mediation is functioning and third, communicate actionable recommendations for policymakers, practitioners and donors on how innovations in peace mediation can support more effective peace processes and initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
